message: "If you use or discuss this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Dynamic Relational Transitioning Geometry (TRPG): code, data and documents"
abstract: "A relational, entanglement-based framework that reproduces known physics (light bending, cosmic expansion, neutron stars, lepton masses, quark charges) and predicts normal-ordered neutrino masses of 0.36, 8.7 and 50.1 to 50.3 meV (sum 0.0592 to 0.0594 eV). Includes every calculation script, the particle relational workbook, the paper and the later test scripts. Also predicts the strong coupling 0.1178 at the Z, awaiting measurement."
